Lighttpd | 11 | 1.4.40, 1.4.1.4.50 | CVE-2018-19052 | Directory Traversal | Lighttpd 1.4.40–1.4.50 with mod_dirlisting allows listing directories outside web root via '..%2f' / '%2f..' encoded traversal; mod_dirlisting does not sanitize URL-encoded traversal sequences | mod_dirlisting must be enabled (server.modules += ('mod_dirlisting')) | ./cve-2018-19052.sh -u <url> -d <dir> | ./cve-2018-19052.sh -u http://target.com:80 -d /etc | Upgrade to 1.4.51+ or disable mod_dirlisting
