Lighttpd | 0 | <1.4.35 | CVE-2014-2323 | SQL Injection | mod_mysql_vhost interpolates Host header into SQL unsanitized: SELECT doc_root FROM vhosts WHERE hostname='$host'; injection → DB enumeration, LOAD_FILE(), RCE via INTO OUTFILE | mod_mysql_vhost must be loaded (not default) | ./CVE-2014-2323.sh <url> <payload> | ./CVE-2014-2323.sh http://target.com "' OR '1'='1" | Upgrade to 1.4.35+ or remove mod_mysql_vhost
